      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">20 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Structural pattern</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Tier 2</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Facade</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Give a complicated subsystem one simple front door: <code>placeOrder()</code> instead of six services wired by hand, <code>open()</code> instead of a path walk, permission checks and a file-system driver. Learn what a facade should and should not own, how it differs from Adapter and Mediator, and how to keep it from turning into a god class.</p>\n"
  },
